        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Manchester City F.C.\n- Places: Maine Road, City of Manchester Stadium, Manchester, England\n- Products: Etihad Stadium\n- Topics: football stadium capacity rankings\n\nFacts:\n- Manchester City F.C. played at Maine Road from 1923 until 2003.\n- In 2003, Manchester City F.C. moved to the City of Manchester Stadium.\n- The City of Manchester Stadium is in Manchester, England.\n- The City of Manchester Stadium is also known as the Etihad Stadium for sponsorship reasons.\n- The City of Manchester Stadium is the home ground of Manchester City F.C.\n- The City of Manchester Stadium has a domestic football capacity of 55,097.\n- The City of Manchester Stadium is the fourth-largest stadium in the Premier League by domestic football capacity.\n- The City of Manchester Stadium is the eighth-largest stadium in the United Kingdom by domestic football capacity.",
